---
display_code: "5.1"
title: The Business Environment
paper: "2"
order: 5
---

The business environment sits at the heart of Paper 2. Before a student
can evaluate a digital project, they need to understand what kind of
organisation is running it, what that organisation exists to do, and
how digital supports that purpose.

This area covers the full span of Content Area 5.1: the different
purposes and sectors of organisations, the internal functions that
digital tools serve, how digital enables specific business needs such
as stock control or stakeholder collaboration, and the factors that
determine whether a digital project is feasible in the first place.

Topics here lay the groundwork for every scenario in Paper 2 Section B.
Extended response questions almost always open with a business context,
and students who cannot read that context correctly lose marks before
they write a single word of analysis.
